<view class="page"><view class="card"><view class="title">两次顺序测量对比</view><view class="subtitle">选择两条记录叠加查看频谱。青色为 A，橙色为 B。</view></view><view class="card"><view class="section-title">记录 A</view><picker range="{{records}}" range-key="name" bindchange="pick" data-slot="first"><view class="picker">{{first ? first.name : '选择一条记录'}}<text>›</text></view></picker><view class="section-title spacing">记录 B</view><picker range="{{records}}" range-key="name" bindchange="pick" data-slot="second"><view class="picker">{{second ? second.name : '选择另一条记录'}}<text>›</text></view></picker></view><view wx:if="{{warning}}" class="notice">{{warning}}</view><view class="chart-card"><view class="chart-label">频谱叠加 · -100 至 0 dBFS</view><canvas canvas-id="comparison" class="chart" width="694" height="300"></canvas></view></view>
